---
description: StudioSlots project conventions
globs: ["src/**/*.ts", "src/**/*.tsx"]
alwaysApply: true
---

- Next.js 15 App Router, TypeScript strict, Tailwind v4.
- Database access only through `@/lib/db` (Prisma). Never instantiate PrismaClient elsewhere.
- API routes live in `src/app/api/**/route.ts`, validate input with zod schemas from `@/lib/validators`.
- Wrap route handlers in try/catch and return errors via `handleApiError` from `@/lib/api`.
- Auth is cookie sessions from `@/lib/auth` (`getCurrentUser`, `requireUser`, `requireStaff`).
- Members can only see and change their own bookings. Staff manage classes.
- Keep components small; client components only where interactivity is needed.
